(7142283, 1094264, 108069, '<td valign="top">Underworld reference? Like the texture and toning, and this is a nice spin. Great light and murkiness. Very cool.</td>', 'Underworld reference? Like the texture and toning, and this is a nice spin. Great light and murkiness. Very cool.', '2013-12-13 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
