(7142327, 1094291, 37252, '<td valign="top">This is so cute, and with a good perspective. The yellow seems a bit saturated, but nice that you added a touch to the head to make this all fit together well.</td>', 'This is so cute, and with a good perspective. The yellow seems a bit saturated, but nice that you added a touch to the head to make this all fit together well.', '2013-12-13 15:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
