(7144885, 1094933, 114285, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun image for sure, you can''t fault that. Love the way the cat is looking up at the action, the blood splatters on your apron, and the bike and it''s shadow, however the size of the dogs head on the bird does not compliment one another, and I know this is an absurd challenge to start with, but looking at other entries on here some blend in quite well!<br/> <br/>Having said that I gave you an 8.</td>', 'It''s a fun image for sure, you can''t fault that. Love the way the cat is looking up at the action, the blood splatters on your apron, and the bike and it''s shadow, however the size of the dogs head on the bird does not compliment one another, and I know this is an absurd challenge to start with, but looking at other entries on here some blend in quite well! Having said that I gave you an 8.', '2013-12-19 21:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
