(7144911, 1094939, 114285, '<td valign="top">THis is only one artist, and this is my top pick, it was the first off the rack and still my favorite, everything blends in well, and there is method to your madness!<br/> <br/>Handing out my verineat now before I forget <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1070026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg"/></a> 10<br/> <br/>P.S I think our creator was wise in choosing the right size head for our feathery friends, and although this is a dog with a birds head, it doesn''t look absurd, but actually quite realistic, so very well done in that regards . I''ve also noticed that you are the only one who has depicted a dog with a birds face, edited to add;  actually I just found another one!</td>', 'THis is only one artist, and this is my top pick, it was the first off the rack and still my favorite, everything blends in well, and there is method to your madness! Handing out my verineat now before I forget  10 P.S I think our creator was wise in choosing the right size head for our feathery friends, and although this is a dog with a birds head, it doesn''t look absurd, but actually quite realistic, so very well done in that regards . I''ve also noticed that you are the only one who has depicted a dog with a birds face, edited to add;  actually I just found another one!', '2013-12-19 22:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
