(7145137, 1094933, 30364, '<td valign="top">I deeply admire your dedication to your craft, Christophe.  As I am in awe of how very good you are at it.  Your stuff isn''t to my own taste, but that''s my problem and not yours.  When I look at your works, I find that I very quickly reproach my self to lighten up and enjoy your wonderfully absurd sense of humour, and your unparalleled (at least at DPC) mastery of digital imagery.  DPC is very lucky to have you in the community.  Congratulations, and thank you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-12-20 04:59:40.</i></td>', 'I deeply admire your dedication to your craft, Christophe.  As I am in awe of how very good you are at it.  Your stuff isn''t to my own taste, but that''s my problem and not yours.  When I look at your works, I find that I very quickly reproach my self to lighten up and enjoy your wonderfully absurd sense of humour, and your unparalleled (at least at DPC) mastery of digital imagery.  DPC is very lucky to have you in the community.  Congratulations, and thank you.', '2013-12-20 04:58:10.000000', '2013-12-20 04:59:40.000000', 0),
(7145143, 1094233, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, Stagaroo!!</td>', 'Nicely done, Stagaroo!!', '2013-12-20 05:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
