(7504187, 1094828, 182284, '<td valign="top">I knew there was coming a great story behind this one, the birds feet were all curled up. I thought you had propped up a dead bird for this. Hope he made it. If you ever see a brown headed black bird with a patch over his eye. He''s a tough little bugger. I shot him with a daisy BB gun in the eye and when I went to retreve the dead body he got up and flew off with one good eye.</td>', 'I knew there was coming a great story behind this one, the birds feet were all curled up. I thought you had propped up a dead bird for this. Hope he made it. If you ever see a brown headed black bird with a patch over his eye. He''s a tough little bugger. I shot him with a daisy BB gun in the eye and when I went to retreve the dead body he got up and flew off with one good eye.', '2017-03-07 00:57:01.000000', NULL, 0),
